{"version":1,"content":"<p>Mozilla今年為Firefox推出了名為Nova的全新界面設計，希望藉此吸引更多Chromium系瀏覽器的用户。Nova採用了更常見的現代圓角設計風格，與GoogleChrome長期使用的設計語言相近。與此同時，Mozilla還公佈了新的Firefox路線圖，方便愛好者了解後續功能計劃。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588228.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T12:43:56.957675+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T12:18:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T12:37:17.639573+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T12:37:17.639573+00:00","content_hash":"70ec3096c8e3eefb092f3fe2f2f6e325660943df4aabddfdfe6604847e9e01ee","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}